    "nextDirection": "If the tilt survives, the open question is whether the `lowvol` sleeve itself belongs in the alpha layer or the risk layer — that two-risk-channel move is explicitly out of scope here and belongs to its own study, per the pre-registration. If the tilt does not survive, the denominator was the channel and the sleeve question is less urgent. Either way, `dynamic-breadth-v1`, `region-quota-removal-v1` and `entry-selection-separation-v1` remain pre-registered and untouched by this result.",
